5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to agree on what evidence matters before we pick a plan. Who is looking into the crew rosters?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm checking the two pilots from eight years ago. We always repeat the same mistakes without reading the closure reports first.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am reviewing the joint operators' committee minutes. I need to know who else has to say yes before we commit to any delivery date.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m looking at the capital ledger balances. I need to see what we’re actually committed to paying in the years after this.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m checking the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city. I want to see if the stopwatch story matches the complaints!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, please keep us posted on the ledger. I need to know if the money is actually there before we discuss the work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, if the minutes show who else has to say yes, that’s exactly the kind of hidden delay I’m worried about.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, exactly. The drawings are clean, but the approvals are where the ground hides. I’ll report back.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I’ll do my best. I just want to make sure we aren’t arguing over pots again.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I hope the stopwatch proves the crowds aren’t the real problem! I’ll bring the numbers.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, if the stopwatch shows the crowds clear quickly, then the real delay is elsewhere. Please confirm that for us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, if the stopwatch proves the crowds clear quickly, then the real delay is elsewhere. Please confirm that for us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, I’ll confirm the approval chain. If the ferry and rail back offices are still out of sync, that’s where the delay hides.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I’ll check if the ledger shows enough room for the long-term costs, not just the initial price.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I’ll bring the stopwatch numbers. If the crowds clear fast, we’re fixing the wrong part of the trip!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I’ll review the roster books for the late-turn pool. We cannot promise service if the crews are already stretched thin.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’ll also check the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. I want to see if those old projects actually stuck or just stalled.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll also check the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I need to know what the ground might hide before we trust any delivery date.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll also check the journey audits on where minutes go. I need to see if the long-term costs match the actual delays.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I’ll also check the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I want to see if the money is going to the right place!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
